#MOBILE
Vnum       200
Keywords   toll robot ticket token~
Short      a ticket robot~
Long       A robot is here collecting maglev car tokens.
~
Desc       This is a plain looking robot whos only purpose day in and day out is to
collect credits and tokens for entrance into the transit system. It
doesn't apear that it would be useful in any other capacity.
~
Race       Human~
Position   aggressive~
DefPos     aggressive~
Gender     neuter~
Actflags   npc sentinel~
Affected   detect_invis~
Stats1     0 5 0 95 0 0
Stats2     1 8 1
Stats3     1 4 0
Stats4     0 0 0 0 0
Attribs    10 16 12 14 12 9 10 0
Saves      0 0 0 0 0
Speaks     common~
Speaking   common~
