Desc     The walkway is a long corridor enclosed in transpariplast windows.
Through the windows you can see that the spaceport is surrounded by
mountains to the south and a seemongly endless city that stretches
out in all other directions.

Wayfinding bands identify this part of The Hague Interstellar Terminal in several common trade languages.
~
