Desc     This large room is filled with benches and chairs. Most are arranged
in rows or around small islands of plants. Some however are arranged
in small groups  facing each other. Scattered amidst the seats are
many tables housing abandoned magazines. There is a projection display showing
an old movie in one corner of the room.

Tall pressure-rated windows give brief views of Earth-orbit traffic approaching the terminal.
~
