Desc     The entranceway of the Scheveningen Arcology Ridge Spaceport is a large wide
staicase  leading from the walkway outside down to the spaceport
lobby. A large set of double doors opens and closes automaticly as
people approach.

Terran Union customs, transit and emergency markings are integrated into the terminal walls.
~
