Desc     This long narrow room is devided down the middle by a wide maglev car
track. The maglev cars move at extremely high speeds and as they
aproach a gust of wind tugs at you threatening to knock you off
ballance. When the maglev car comes to a complete stop you may "board"
it and look for a seat.

Tall pressure-rated windows give brief views of Earth-orbit traffic approaching the terminal.
~
